### 16. Forbidden Patterns - AUTOMATIC REJECTION

- **❌ NO Traditional Mockito**: Using `when().thenReturn()` or `verify()` (must use BDDMockito)
- **❌ NO Arrange/Act/Assert**: Using traditional AAA comments (must use Given/When/Then)
- **❌ NO Missing this.**: Direct instance variable access (must use `this.`)
- **❌ NO Framework Testing**: Testing Spring transaction management or JPA functionality
- **❌ NO Repository Testing**: Testing repository query implementation
- **❌ NO Embedded Factories**: TestDataFactory as inner class in test files
- **❌ NO Multiple Data Scenarios**: Testing different data unless business logic changes

